{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11115221","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11115221","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:4:1111522101:1":{"text":"あららぁ……君には失望したよ、プルースト。","source_cn":"哎呀呀……普鲁斯托，你这家伙太令我失望了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A66EA7FEB090EA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111522102:1":{"text":"君の力があれば、今度こそうまくいくと思ったのになぁ。","source_cn":"我还以为凭你的力量，这次一定不会失手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49146C169885BDC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111522103:1":{"text":"それにしても、あいつらが神からもらった力ってのは何なんだろうねぇ？","source_cn":"不过话说回来，他们从神明那里得到的力量是什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31B163D8804AC4A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111522104:1":{"text":"カタストロフにとどめを刺せるほどの力……気になるなぁ。","source_cn":"那个能够给予恶魔最后一击的力量……究竟是什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x331085D5535FF14B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111522105:1":{"text":"ちゃんと調べる必要がありそうだねぇ。","source_cn":"有必要好好调查一番。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC422BB9340A9653D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","documen